1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,200
Hold up your phone.

2
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,177
The Eiffel Tower

3
00:00:02,177 --> 00:00:03,490
can grow that much

4
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:04,600
in summer.

5
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:05,375
Hot iron

6
00:00:05,375 --> 00:00:06,533
stretches...

7
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:07,198
like a cat

8
00:00:07,198 --> 00:00:08,700
in a sunbeam.

9
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,146
Eighteen thousand

10
00:00:10,146 --> 00:00:11,480
iron pieces,

11
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,089
each one

12
00:00:12,089 --> 00:00:13,600
a hair longer.

13
00:00:13,641 --> 00:00:15,170
Stack it all up...

14
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:16,700
one PHONE.

15
00:00:16,743 --> 00:00:18,047
And on sunny days,

16
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:19,019
the sunny side

17
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:20,133
stretches more,

18
00:00:20,178 --> 00:00:20,807
so the top

19
00:00:20,807 --> 00:00:22,050
leans AWAY

20
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:23,530
from the Sun.

21
00:00:23,713 --> 00:00:24,720
Honestly?

22
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,819
Same.

